    "type": "game",
    "name": "Jetpack Pizza Delivery Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3857270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Jetpack Pizza Delivery Simulator' is a fun little Restaurant Management simulator I made in my free time, to help pay for my college classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the current Owner and Operator of '[customizable name] Pizza', a mega-restaurant located in the heart of Pizzapolis: the city of cholesterol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You possess a trusty Jetpack with infinite fuel capacity, and you must FLY AROUND THE CITY delivering pizza orders: on time, with the correct amount.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware your restaurant falling below 1 star: you will be punished and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(i made this game by myself in my dorm room over the course of about 2 weeks. I hope you enjoy it. I had a ton of fun coding it :) )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Luke</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Jetpack Pizza Delivery Simulator' is a fun little Restaurant Management simulator I made in my free time, to help pay for my college classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the current Owner and Operator of '[customizable name] Pizza', a mega-restaurant located in the heart of Pizzapolis: the city of cholesterol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You possess a trusty Jetpack with infinite fuel capacity, and you must FLY AROUND THE CITY delivering pizza orders: on time, with the correct amount.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware your restaurant falling below 1 star: you will be punished and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(i made this game by myself in my dorm room over the course of about 2 weeks. I hope you enjoy it. I had a ton of fun coding it :) )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Luke</p>",
    "short_description": "Fly around a giant futuristic city in a Jetpack, delivering pizzas to people. Upgrade your Restaurant, manage your inventory, upgrade your jetpack, and hire Assistants to fly around delivering pizzas for you! Infinite hours of fun.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
